      },
      {
         "id": "3a606d7e-6c08-4d5c-891c-77f835a7e7db",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "thinking",
         "source_menu": [],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### ¡Vamos a Pensar!\n\nEscribimos las cinco primeras centenas cambiando solo los símbolos que usamos en las cinco primeras decenas: X, XX, XXX, XL y L se convirtieron en C, CC, CCC, CD y D.\n\n¿Podemos continuar usando la misma lógica con los grupos restantes (600 a 1000)?",
               "source": null,
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
         "desc": null,
         "next": "26f9dfa0-dd4e-4bf3-86bc-bbe61c9a4196",
         "prev": "",
         "jumpTo": "",
         "answer": "yes",
         "score": 2,
         "position": ""
      },
      {
         "id": "26f9dfa0-dd4e-4bf3-86bc-bbe61c9a4196",
         "audio": "",
         "smile": "happy",
         "source_menu": [
